cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FBKdock in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "FBKdock: Fully Automated End-to-End Molecular Docking Pipeline"
abstract: "FBKdock is a cross-platform (Windows & Linux) pipeline that automates the complete molecular docking workflow: receptor preparation (interactive residue cleaning, PDB2PQR with AMBER force field and PROPKA titration, ADFRsuite PDBQT conversion), co-crystallized ligand redocking with a symmetry-aware RMSD quality gate, and batch virtual screening (GFN2-xTB minimization and Meeko PDBQT preparation) powered by Vina-GPU or AutoDock Vina."
